<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:#0D523F;">
  A role assigned to you changed
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888B8B;">
  Role configuration
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  A role assigned to your Dukka staff account was updated. Review the details below — your day-to-day access may look different after this change.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Role" value=roleName}}
  {{> detail-row label="Hierarchy" value=hierarchy}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="Need clarification?"}}
  If this role change affects work you are responsible for, check with your administrator so expectations and access stay aligned.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  We will keep you informed whenever roles that affect you are adjusted.
</p>
